{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"externalID":"AdaScripting","symbolKind":"module","title":"Ada Script","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script is AdaEngine’s scripting layer for gameplay and ECS integration. Its source files use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" extension. The current implementation uses an embedded language runtime, while the public API, diagnostics, and tooling consistently present Ada Script concepts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Annotations are not only syntax. AdaEngine resolves every query into native archetypes and component columns and publishes its component access to the scheduler.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use Ada Script for gameplay rules that benefit from quick iteration. Keep rendering backends, custom data structures, and other low-level or performance-critical facilities in Swift."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada","code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform, Movement)","    var movers;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in movers) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            var velocity = entity.movement.velocity;","            position[0] += velocity[0] * context.deltaTime;","            position[1] += velocity[1] * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEditor projects configure automatic script discovery by default. For an existing Swift package, follow ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},{"type":"text","text":" to enable the build plugin and register the generated script plugins."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptTesting"],"title":"ECS Integration","anchor":"ECS-Integration"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError"],"anchor":"Runtime-API","title":"Runtime API"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/NativeAOT"],"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptNativePlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptObjectCatalog","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptObjectReloadCandidate","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptToolRuntime"],"anchor":